{#
  The journey of one booking (issue #462): the ONE answer the dashboard
  gives to « where is it, and what do I do? ».

  It replaces two cards that asked that question twice — « L'action
  suivante » above and « Où en est cette location » below, each with its
  own reading of the same checklist (D3). Both halves are still here, in
  one card, from one derivation (Booking\BookingJourney):

  - **the heading** names what holds the booking up, puts forward the one
    action that moves it on — never a refusal nor a cancellation (D7) — and
    folds every other decision behind a secondary button;
  - **the stretches** follow the scout-year page's timeline pattern (D4):
    five sections, the current one open, each step numbered, with its
    nature and its control (`_journey_steps.html.twig`). Two things of that
    page are deliberately NOT copied (D5): there is no indicative date per
    stretch, since a booking's dates are its stay's, not the site's; and
    the order is a lock here, not advice — `BookingStatus` is a real
    machine, so a stretch the booking has not reached is inert.

  Two refreshable regions, so an action re-renders both halves:
  `next-step` (the heading) and `milestones` (the stretches).

  Requires `journey`, `asset`, `booking`, `booking_url` and
  `renter_decisions`.
#}
<div class="card mb-4" id="parcours">
    <div data-booking-panel="next-step">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Où en est cette réservation</h2>
            {% set primary = journey.primaryAction %}
            {% set others = journey.otherDecisions %}
            <p class="fw-semibold mb-1">{{ journey.headline }}</p>
            {% if journey.next and journey.next.explanation %}
                <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">{{ journey.next.explanation }}</p>
            {% endif %}

            {% if primary or others is not empty %}
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3">
                    {% if primary %}
                        {% include '@rental/management/_milestone_action.html.twig' with {
                            action: primary, primary: true,
                            asset: asset, booking: booking, booking_url: booking_url, renter_decisions: renter_decisions,
                        } only %}
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if others is not empty %}
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary collapsed"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#other-decisions"
                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="other-decisions">
                            Autres décisions ({{ others|length }})
                        </button>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
                {% if others is not empty %}
                    <div class="collapse" id="other-decisions">
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
                            {% for action in others %}
                                {% include '@rental/management/_milestone_action.html.twig' with {
                                    action: action, small: true,
                                    asset: asset, booking: booking, booking_url: booking_url, renter_decisions: renter_decisions,
                                } only %}
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
                <p class="form-text mb-0 mt-2">
                    Une seule action est mise en avant : celle qui fait avancer la réservation. Le locataire est
                    prévenu par email d'une confirmation, d'un refus, d'une annulation, d'une proposition ou
                    d'une demande de précision.
                </p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-body border-top" data-booking-panel="milestones">
        <p class="text-body-secondary small">
            Les étapes se suivent dans cet ordre : chacune attend la précédente. Les dates sont celles du
            séjour, pas des échéances du site.
        </p>
        {% for phase in journey.phases %}
            {% set phase_id = 'phase-' ~ phase.key %}
            <section class="border-bottom" data-phase="{{ phase.key }}">
                <h3 class="mb-0">
                    <button type="button"
                            class="btn w-100 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 px-0 py-2 text-start{{ phase.isCurrent ? '' : ' collapsed' }}"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#{{ phase_id }}"
                            aria-expanded="{{ phase.isCurrent ? 'true' : 'false' }}" aria-controls="{{ phase_id }}">
                        <span class="fw-semibold">{{ phase.label }}</span>
                        {% if phase.isCurrent %}
                            <span class="badge text-bg-primary">en cours</span>
                        {% elseif phase.isDone %}
                            <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success-emphasis">terminée</span>
                        {% endif %}
                        <span class="flex-grow-1"></span>
                        <span class="text-body-secondary small">{{ phase.summary }}</span>
                        <i class="bi bi-chevron-down text-body-tertiary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    </button>
                </h3>
                <div class="collapse{{ phase.isCurrent ? ' show' }}" id="{{ phase_id }}">
                    <div class="pb-3">
                        <p class="text-body-secondary small">{{ phase.description }}</p>
                        {% include '@rental/management/_journey_steps.html.twig' with {
                            phase: phase, next_key: journey.next ? journey.next.key : null,
                            asset: asset, booking: booking, booking_url: booking_url, renter_decisions: renter_decisions,
                        } only %}

                        {% if phase.key == 'request' %}
                            {# The option lives with the request it holds the dates for. #}
                            <div data-booking-panel="hold">
                            {% if not booking.status.isFinal %}
                                <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/option" class="row g-2 align-items-end mt-3">
                                    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                                    <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-7">
                                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                            field_id: 'option-until', field_name: 'until', type: 'datetime-local',
                                            label: 'Option jusqu\'au',
                                            value: booking.holdUntil|iso_datetime_local,
                                        } only %}
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-5">
                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary w-100">Enregistrer l'option</button>
                                    </div>
                                    {# Under the row, not under the field — see
                                       design.md §7.6: `align-items-end` aligns the
                                       bottoms of the columns, not their controls. #}
                                    <p class="form-text col-12 mb-0">
                                        Une option engage l'unité jusqu'à l'échéance : si elle passe sans
                                        confirmation, la réservation devient expirée et les dates se libèrent.
                                        Laisser vide et enregistrer lève le blocage.
                                    </p>
                                </form>
                            {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        {% endfor %}
        <p class="text-body-secondary small mt-3 mb-0">
            Une case à cocher n'apparaît que sur les étapes <strong>hors du site</strong> : les autres se
            dérivent de ce qui s'est passé ici, et une coche manuelle à côté créerait une seconde vérité.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
